{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956820/extras/0d5c4c1955c8312769dc76f7e91abb03.avif?t=1772712710\" width=739 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may look cute, but this game is tough. Candy monsters attack from every side, and they never stop. Run, shoot, and build towers at the same time to survive. Each run is different, with new enemies, upgrades, and massive candy bosses. Lose, level up, and jump back in stronger this colorful world hides a serious challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956820/extras/68f79a63fe0e6ff4a6adbedc7ddddea8.poster.avif?t=1772712710\" width=1170 height=790 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956820/extras/68f79a63fe0e6ff4a6adbedc7ddddea8.webm?t=1772712710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956820/extras/68f79a63fe0e6ff4a6adbedc7ddddea8.mp4?t=1772712710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956820/extras/d29c15e594aecb000efc384a8e5dfcfa.avif?t=1772712710\" width=994 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep moving, blast candy monsters, and build towers to stay alive as chaos grows. Candy attacks come from every direction, and the waves never stop. Use powerful weapons like shotguns, miniguns, and RPGs to take down gummy bears, lollipops, and massive candy bosses. Every run is different, with new enemies, upgrades, and challenges to test your reflexes and strategy. Lose a run, level up your skills, and jump back in stronger. In this colorful, chaotic world, surviving takes quick thinking, fast moves, and clever tower-building.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956820/extras/8f3b4691092ac000deb98713ada6487a.poster.avif?t=1772712710\" width=1170 height=830 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956820/extras/8f3b4691092ac000deb98713ada6487a.webm?t=1772712710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956820/extras/8f3b4691092ac000deb98713ada6487a.mp4?t=1772712710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956820/extras/ffdb324b8944ff183171f7f03ff77e06.avif?t=1772712710\" width=994 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute candy monsters are out for revenge! Gummy bears, lollipops, and marshmallows attack endlessly from every direction, and the chaos never stops. Run through colorful worlds, blast enemies with powerful weapons like shotguns, miniguns, and RPGs, and build towers to defend yourself. Each run is different, with new enemies, upgrades, and huge candy bosses that push your skills to the limit. Lose a run, level up, and come back stronger. In this sweet but deadly world, survival takes fast thinking, clever building, and lightning fast reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956820/extras/2e87c40d8bee81df0bff58c600141091.poster.avif?t=1772712710\" width=1170 height=786 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956820/extras/2e87c40d8bee81df0bff58c600141091.webm?t=1772712710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https: